flowchart LR
  SRC[Employer Source / HR Clarification] --> REQ[Requirement ID]
  REQ --> DEC[Design Decision / ADR]
  DEC --> CTRL[Policy and Enforcement Point]
  CTRL --> TEST[Positive / Negative / Bypass Test]
  TEST --> EVID[Observed Result and Evidence]
  EVID --> OWNER[Accountable Owner / Reviewer]
  SESSION[Actual AI Session] --> RAW[Complete Raw Export]
  RAW --> HASH[SHA-256 and Manifest]
  HASH --> EVID
